'''Eldritch ashes''' are [[Akkha]]'s remains that can be obtained in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]; to obtain it, the player has to deal the most damage to him.

It is given to the [[High Priest (Sophanem)|High Priest of Sophanem]] after having spoken to the [[Bank Camel]], as part of obtaining the [[Ancient key (Tombs of Amascut)|ancient key]] from them. Doing so requires having completed the [[miniquest]] [[Into the Tombs]].

